WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Reality NAS Player scans and plays your NAS library on PICO Space Pro.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.733
Scan films, TV series, documentaries and anime. File names, folders and NFO files supply clues.

00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:05.600
Look up movie titles and release years through public catalogues without an API key.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.433
Group TV episodes by season and number. AniList and Bangumi help identify anime.

00:00:07.433 --> 00:00:09.300
Open shared folders over SMB, WebDAV, NFS, FTP or SFTP.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.800
Browse Jellyfin, Emby, Plex and DLNA media servers.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.033
Identify films by their covers. Search or filter the poster wall.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:14.900
Select a cover to see the synopsis, cast and available versions.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.133
Play MKV, MP4, MOV, AVI, WebM, transport streams and legacy formats such as WMV and RMVB.

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:18.600
Play the main feature of compatible unencrypted Blu-ray and DVD backups.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.467
Switch text or bitmap subtitles, including SRT, WebVTT, ASS/SSA, PGS and VobSub.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:21.967
Switch between embedded audio tracks or add an external dub. DTS, TrueHD and AAC are supported.

00:00:21.967 --> 00:00:23.067
Space Lounge.

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:24.200
Private Cinema.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.300
Village Square.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.433
Desert Camp.

00:00:26.433 --> 00:00:28.667
Play VR180 and 360° video. Choose the projection and look around.

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:30.133
Choose side-by-side or top-and-bottom stereoscopic playback.

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:31.369
Reality NAS Player for PICO Space Pro.
